      "widgets_values": [
        "A captivating digital illustration of a young woman in a flowing, vibrant crimson gown, twirling gracefully amidst falling rose petals. She has long, dark hair adorned with small bows and holds a single red rose aloft in her raised right hand. The composition is dynamic, capturing movement with her voluminous dress swirling around her bare feet on a soft, dusty pink ground. The background is a muted, creamy beige, providing a subtle contrast to the vivid red. Cinematic lighting casts a warm glow on the scene, highlighting the delicate folds of the fabric and the texture of the petals. The mood is romantic and ethereal, rendered with high detail and a painterly yet polished aesthetic, evoking a dreamlike, storybook quality."
      ],
