      "widgets_values": [
        "Analyze the image and create a detailed prompt only. Describe the main subject, architectural style, environment, composition, camera angle, lighting, mood, materials, colors, reflections, foreground, background, and important small details. Write it as one natural prompt with rich visual description, suitable for image generation. Include photography or render style terms such as photorealistic, cinematic lighting, high detail, realistic materials, sharp focus, and professional architectural visualization when appropriate. Do not explain. Do not use bullet points. Do not mention that this is an image. Output only one detailed prompt, around 100 to 160 words, no extra text.",
